from the black rook on a2 and has no safe square, so the cannon will probably
be lost. Still, taking the knight first at least makes it an even
knight-for-cannon trade. After that I have a rook, two pawns, two advisors and
two bishops against black's rook, cannon, three pawns and two advisors. My
defences are complete, so I can hold. } 车１平２ 28. 车七平八 { [%emt 0:01:59]
